    "notes":  "Adds two original tool choices: Light Tool Grip (-10% attack stamina, +15% wear) and Reinforced Tool Frame (-25% wear, +10% stamina). Craft at a workbench without a schematic; fits non-motor harvesting/salvage tools with a slot, one Workshop tool choice at a time. Motor tools and repair hammers/nailguns excluded. Crafting trains Workstations to 25. Existing 630 routes/melee grips retained. Live equipped/slot checks pending.",
